  "updated_at": "2026-04-03",
  "bio": "Delve into the bold and resonant world of ink at Roadhouse Tattoos & Piercings, a haven for aficionados of the distinct trashpolka style since 1997. Nestled in the heartland of Holland, NY, this studio is renowned for its edgy artistic flair and unwavering dedication to craftsmanship. For bookings, reach out to us at 716.537.4828 or roadhousetattoosny@gmail.com, where your vision is transformed into a striking statement.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Holland, New York, United States",
  "tattooing_since": "1997"
